#. Plugin Name of the plugin
msgid "Gift Vouchers for Amelia"
msgstr ""

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
msgid "https://github.com/glx77/gift-vouchers-for-amelia"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
msgid "Sell gift vouchers for your Amelia services through WooCommerce. Each paid order automatically generates a single-use 100% Amelia coupon restricted to the purchased service."
msgstr "Vendez des bons cadeaux pour vos services Amelia via WooCommerce. Chaque commande payée génère automatiquement un coupon Amelia 100% à usage unique, restreint au service acheté."

#. Author of the plugin
msgid "Glow with Lilou"
msgstr ""

